<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM Q3 net loss seven million guilders.</title>
<headline>KLM Q3 net loss seven million guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 96/97 to end-Dec.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss					 7.0   vs  102 profit</p>
<p>    Loss per share (guilders)		  0.12  vs  1.08 profit</p>
<p>    Operating loss				19.0   vs  56.0 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts for third quarter net results at KLM Royal Dutch Airlines ranged from a loss of 54 million guilders to a profit of 12 million guilders. Operating results were seen ranging from a 25 million guilder loss to a profit of 35 million.  </p>
<p>    Traffic revenue (billions)		 2.22  vs    2.06</p>
<p>    Other revenue				328     vs  296</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billions)    2.55  vs    2.35</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses (billions)    2.57  vs    2.30</p>
<p>    Financial charges			   37     vs   41</p>
<p>    Profit on asset sales			8     vs    1 loss</p>
<p>    Income from Northwest Airlines	   3     vs   89</p>
<p>    Income from other holdings		25     vs    7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss				  20     vs  110 profit</p>
<p>    Tax credit				    13     vs    8 debit</p>
<p>    Cash flow from operations		 88     vs  258</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
